            When I was at rock bottom, a hand reached out.</br>
            A great friend and brother-in-arms introduced me to Cybersecurity.</br>
            I found the spark that was missing to reignite my fire.</br>
            Technology saved me from the darkness and gave me back what had been stolen from me.</br>
            That is hope</br>
          </p>
          <p>
            I rescued the language that was taken from me and decided to
            use it to baptize my answer to the world.
          </p>
